         (Configured/OpenFB/ClosedFB/Healthy/LocalMode) it used to combine itself — on Screen_Home
         that is 96 reads/cycle instead of 480. -->
    <Member Name="StateCode" Datatype="Array[1..96] of Int" Remanence="NonRetain" Accessibility="Public">
      <AttributeList>
